   <h1>The Power Of Kindness</h1>
   <h2>One sunny morning,a boy named Mark was waiting to school when he saw an</h2>
   <h3>old man carrying heavy bags. The old man looked tired,so Mark decided to help him</h3>
   <h4>Even though Mark was already late,he carried the bags until they reach the old man house</h4></<center>
   <h5>the old man thanked him and said ,"your kindness means lot to me." </h5><center>
   <h6>When mark arrived at school his teacher asked why he was late.Mark explained what happend,</h6>
   <h7>and his teacher praised him for helping someone need.
